{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WMz5Rt9Cynk2x5XPntPmWF","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — StructFuse\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main\n5\t- Deadline: ARR May 25, 2026\n6\t\n7\t## Core Claims (3)\n8\t\n9\t1. **True embedding-distance hard negative mining consistently improves contrastive code retrieval over random baselines, correcting the prior misconception that embedding negatives harm performance.** The reported \"harm\" (CoCoHaNeRe-derived, -27pp R@1) was an artifact of BM25-proxy negatives mislabeled as embedding-distance — genuine embedding mining yields +1.6–2.0pp R@1 across two architecturally distinct encoders (Qwen2.5-Coder-3B, StarCoder2-3B).\n10\t\n11\t2. **Structure-grounded (dataflow) hard negatives provide conditional additional benefit beyond embedding mining, mediated by encoder representation saturation.** When pretrained encoder representations are compressed (pos_sim > 0.98, as in Qwen), random and embedding negatives become too easy; dataflow-disconnected negatives force discrimination along a structural dimension the encoder cannot separate via text alone. When representation space is healthy (pos_sim ~ 0.80, as in StarCoder), embedding mining alone suffices. Mechanism: neg_difficulty margin analysis (+17% Qwen, +28% StarCoder) provides quantitative evidence for this interaction.\n12\t\n13\t3. **Scope-bounded inter-procedural data-flow analysis via CodeQL is a scalable, model-independent method for computing structural connectivity.** 0% timeout, 78% connected-not-gold rate (Z%), 123/131 repos with output at full scale. Method is a general-purpose structural negative generator applicable beyond code (molecular networks, circuit topology, KG retrieval).\n14\t\n15\t## Story Spine\n16\t\n17\t- **Problem**: Repo-level code repair requires selecting relevant files from large codebases. Current retrievers rely on text similarity alone, but lexical similarity ≠ structural relevance. Hard negative mining is the standard approach to improve contrastive retrievers, yet the field lacks systematic understanding of what negative selection strategies work for code and why.\n18\t\n19\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**:\n20\t  - Text-based retrieval (SweRank, SWE-Fixer): blind to structural dependencies\n21\t  - Graph-guided at inference (LocAgent, RANGER, CodexGraph): structural graphs at inference only, no training signal\n22\t  - ARISE: data-flow but intra-procedural only (no call boundary crossing), runtime tool calls only\n23\t  - CoCoHaNeRe: reports embedding negatives harm code search — but uses BM25 proxy, not true embedding distance\n24\t  - Gap: no systematic study comparing negative mining strategies with proper controls, and no mechanistic explanation for when/why each strategy works\n25\t\n26\t- **Our contribution**: A systematic analysis of hard negative mining strategies for contrastive code retrieval. We (1) correct the misconception that embedding negatives harm performance (BM25 proxy ≠ embedding distance), (2) introduce structure-grounded negatives via inter-procedural dataflow and characterize when they provide additional benefit, and (3) provide mechanistic explanation via representation space saturation analysis.\n27\t\n28\t- **Headline result template**: \"True embedding-distance mining consistently improves code retrieval (+1.6–2.0pp R@1, 2 encoders), correcting prior reports of harm. Structure-grounded (dataflow) negatives provide further conditional benefit (+0.8–2.3pp) when encoder representations are saturated, with the interaction mechanism quantified via negative difficulty analysis.\"\n29\t\n30\t## Core Insight\n31\t\n32\tThe effectiveness of hard negative mining strategies depends on the encoder's representation geometry. When the pretrained space is saturated (high pos_sim → low margin between positive and negative), the encoder needs harder negatives from an orthogonal signal dimension (structure). When the space has healthy separation, embedding-distance mining alone captures sufficient difficulty gradient. This encoder-strategy interaction explains contradictory findings in prior work.\n33\t\n34\t## Dual-Pillar Motivation\n35\t\n36\t1. **Primary — Systematic analysis correcting misconceptions**: Prior work (CoCoHaNeRe) conflated BM25-proxy negatives with true embedding-distance negatives, leading to incorrect conclusions about hard negative mining for code. Our controlled comparison isolates the effect of each strategy.\n37\t2. **Secondary — Mechanistic explanation via representation geometry**: neg_difficulty analysis (margin distribution × strategy × encoder) provides explanatory depth beyond empirical comparison, enabling practitioners to predict which strategy suits their encoder without exhaustive experiments.\n38\t\n39\t## Formal Definition\n40\t\n41\tGiven retrieval domain D, structural graph G, similarity function s, query q:\n42\t**structure-grounded hard negative** = argmax_{x ∈ D : s(x,q) > τ ∧ ¬reachable_G(x,q)} s(x,q)\n43\t\n44\tThe structural graph is externally fixed and does not update with the encoder (drift-immune).\n45\t\n46\t## Title Options\n47\t\n48\t- Primary: \"What Makes Hard Negatives Work for Code Retrieval? A Systematic Study of Mining Strategies and Representation Geometry\"\n49\t- Alternative: \"StructFuse: When and Why Structure-Grounded Hard Negatives Improve Contrastive Code Retrieval\"\n50\t- Backup: \"Correcting Misconceptions in Hard Negative Mining for Code: Embedding Distance Helps, Structure Helps Conditionally\"\n51\t\n52\t## Venue Fit\n53\t\n54\t1. **EMNLP Main fit**: Empirical analysis + mechanistic insight papers are a strong EMNLP archetype (cf. \"Do Language Models...\" papers). Contribution is understanding, not just a new method.\n55\t2. **NLP audience**: Frame as contrastive learning methodology with code as instantiation. Representation geometry analysis generalizes beyond code.\n56\t3. **Against \"incremental\" criticism**: Paper corrects a misconception + provides mechanistic explanation + introduces new negative mining paradigm. Three contributions, not one marginal improvement.\n57\t\n58\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n59\t\n60\t| Concern | Response | Evidence |\n61\t|---------|----------|----------|\n62\t| Only 2 encoders — can you generalize? | n=2 is minimum for interaction claim; we frame as observation with mechanism, not universal law; cross-architecture (decoder vs encoder-decoder) strengthens it | plan_013 (done), m2_full runs |\n63\t| Temperature regime specificity | Ablate τ ∈ {0.05, 0.1, 0.2} | plan_014 |\n64\t| No downstream task evaluation | SWE-bench Lite end-to-end with LLM agent | plan_003 |\n65\t| Static vs dynamic mining confound | Clarify mining is static; add dynamic baseline | plan_015 |\n66\t| CodeQL scalability at larger scale | 0% timeout, 78% Z%, 123 repos; m1_reextract_v2 adds more | plan_006 (done) |\n67\t| Why not compare inference-time graph methods? | Complementary: they navigate at inference, we mine at training. Discuss relationship. | plan_017 |\n68\t| Single benchmark | Add RepoBench-R cross-file retrieval | plan_004 |\n69\t| Statistical significance | Bootstrap 95% CI for all comparisons; full M2 = 9 seeds × 3 strategies × 2 encoders | plan_016, m2_full |\n70\t| \"Complementary signal\" overstatement | Temper: \"conditionally beneficial\" not \"always complementary\" | Writing discipline |\n71\t| Missing related work | RepoFusion, GRACE, GraphCodeBERT, ANCE, curriculum HN mining | Writing task |\n72\t\n73\t## Evidence Status\n74\t\n75\t### Confirmed findings (basis for claims):\n76\t- D017: True embedding mining helps (+2.0pp Qwen, +1.6pp StarCoder) — corrects MVP BM25-proxy artifact\n77\t- D021/neg_difficulty: Qwen pos_sim=0.9855 (saturated), StarCoder pos_sim=0.7985 (healthy); margin differential explains strategy interaction\n78\t- m2_embed_verify (pilot): 3-strategy comparison confirms ranking (embedding > random, dataflow conditional)\n79\t- plan_013 (StarCoder pilot): Confirms cross-encoder pattern — embedding helps both, dataflow helps Qwen only\n80\t- plan_006: CodeQL scalability confirmed at 123-repo scale\n81\t\n82\t### In progress:\n83\t- m2_full_qwen: 9 seeds × 3 strategies (seed 1 running, best R@1=55.3% at step 1000)\n84\t- m2_full_starcoder: 9 seeds × 3 strategies (seed 1 running, R@1=45.4% at step 1000, still improving)\n85\t- m1_reextract_v2: expanded extraction for higher coverage\n86\t\n87\t### Planned (priority order):\n88\t- plan_003: SWE-bench Lite eval (biggest lever for paper strength)\n89\t- plan_014: Temperature ablation (Dream reviewer concern)\n90\t- plan_004: RepoBench-R second benchmark\n91\t- plan_015: Dynamic mining baseline\n92\t- plan_007/008/009: Additional ablations\n93\t\n94\t## Contingency (if full M2 results weaken claims)\n95\t\n96\t### All 18 runs confirm pilot pattern: Best case\n97\t- Full statistical power, paper as framed above\n98\t- Target: EMNLP Main\n99\t\n100\t### Dataflow benefit disappears even for Qwen at full scale: Pivot to 2-claim paper\n101\t- Drop Claim 2 to analysis observation\n102\t- Paper becomes: \"True embedding mining helps (correcting misconception) + CodeQL extraction is practical + representation geometry analysis explains prior contradictions\"\n103\t- Still publishable: correcting misconception + mechanistic analysis is sufficient for EMNLP Main\n104\t\n105\t### Embedding mining also loses advantage at full scale: Major reassessment needed\n106\t- Recheck data pipeline for bugs (full-scale data may have distribution differences)\n107\t- If confirmed: negative result paper — \"Why Hard Negative Mining Doesn't Scale for Code Retrieval\"\n108\t- Discuss with user before committing direction\n109\t\n110\t## Deprecated Claims (with reason)\n111\t\n112\t- ~~\"Embedding-distance hard negatives actively harm code retrieval\"~~ — FALSIFIED by D017. Original evidence (-27pp R@1) was from BM25-proxy negatives incorrectly labeled as embedding_distance in MVP. True embedding mining shows consistent improvement. Preserved here to prevent regression.\n113\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0e74a8f6-0a91-487b-9437-3d2c0cc79eae","uuid":"41882407-6a63-41b3-a5af-dd0bbc63d47a","timestamp":"2026-05-14T08:11:51.386Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/structfuse-context/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T075732/best/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — StructFuse\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main\n- Deadline: ARR May 25, 2026\n\n## Core Claims (3)\n\n1. **True embedding-distance hard negative mining consistently improves contrastive code retrieval over random baselines, correcting the prior misconception that embedding negatives harm performance.** The reported \"harm\" (CoCoHaNeRe-derived, -27pp R@1) was an artifact of BM25-proxy negatives mislabeled as embedding-distance — genuine embedding mining yields +1.6–2.0pp R@1 across two architecturally distinct encoders (Qwen2.5-Coder-3B, StarCoder2-3B).\n\n2. **Structure-grounded (dataflow) hard negatives provide conditional additional benefit beyond embedding mining, mediated by encoder representation saturation.** When pretrained encoder representations are compressed (pos_sim > 0.98, as in Qwen), random and embedding negatives become too easy; dataflow-disconnected negatives force discrimination along a structural dimension the encoder cannot separate via text alone. When representation space is healthy (pos_sim ~ 0.80, as in StarCoder), embedding mining alone suffices. Mechanism: neg_difficulty margin analysis (+17% Qwen, +28% StarCoder) provides quantitative evidence for this interaction.\n\n3. **Scope-bounded inter-procedural data-flow analysis via CodeQL is a scalable, model-independent method for computing structural connectivity.** 0% timeout, 78% connected-not-gold rate (Z%), 123/131 repos with output at full scale. Method is a general-purpose structural negative generator applicable beyond code (molecular networks, circuit topology, KG retrieval).\n\n## Story Spine\n\n- **Problem**: Repo-level code repair requires selecting relevant files from large codebases. Current retrievers rely on text similarity alone, but lexical similarity ≠ structural relevance. Hard negative mining is the standard approach to improve contrastive retrievers, yet the field lacks systematic understanding of what negative selection strategies work for code and why.\n\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**:\n  - Text-based retrieval (SweRank, SWE-Fixer): blind to structural dependencies\n  - Graph-guided at inference (LocAgent, RANGER, CodexGraph): structural graphs at inference only, no training signal\n  - ARISE: data-flow but intra-procedural only (no call boundary crossing), runtime tool calls only\n  - CoCoHaNeRe: reports embedding negatives harm code search — but uses BM25 proxy, not true embedding distance\n  - Gap: no systematic study comparing negative mining strategies with proper controls, and no mechanistic explanation for when/why each strategy works\n\n- **Our contribution**: A systematic analysis of hard negative mining strategies for contrastive code retrieval. We (1) correct the misconception that embedding negatives harm performance (BM25 proxy ≠ embedding distance), (2) introduce structure-grounded negatives via inter-procedural dataflow and characterize when they provide additional benefit, and (3) provide mechanistic explanation via representation space saturation analysis.\n\n- **Headline result template**: \"True embedding-distance mining consistently improves code retrieval (+1.6–2.0pp R@1, 2 encoders), correcting prior reports of harm. Structure-grounded (dataflow) negatives provide further conditional benefit (+0.8–2.3pp) when encoder representations are saturated, with the interaction mechanism quantified via negative difficulty analysis.\"\n\n## Core Insight\n\nThe effectiveness of hard negative mining strategies depends on the encoder's representation geometry. When the pretrained space is saturated (high pos_sim → low margin between positive and negative), the encoder needs harder negatives from an orthogonal signal dimension (structure). When the space has healthy separation, embedding-distance mining alone captures sufficient difficulty gradient. This encoder-strategy interaction explains contradictory findings in prior work.\n\n## Dual-Pillar Motivation\n\n1. **Primary — Systematic analysis correcting misconceptions**: Prior work (CoCoHaNeRe) conflated BM25-proxy negatives with true embedding-distance negatives, leading to incorrect conclusions about hard negative mining for code. Our controlled comparison isolates the effect of each strategy.\n2. **Secondary — Mechanistic explanation via representation geometry**: neg_difficulty analysis (margin distribution × strategy × encoder) provides explanatory depth beyond empirical comparison, enabling practitioners to predict which strategy suits their encoder without exhaustive experiments.\n\n## Formal Definition\n\nGiven retrieval domain D, structural graph G, similarity function s, query q:\n**structure-grounded hard negative** = argmax_{x ∈ D : s(x,q) > τ ∧ ¬reachable_G(x,q)} s(x,q)\n\nThe structural graph is externally fixed and does not update with the encoder (drift-immune).\n\n## Title Options\n\n- Primary: \"What Makes Hard Negatives Work for Code Retrieval? A Systematic Study of Mining Strategies and Representation Geometry\"\n- Alternative: \"StructFuse: When and Why Structure-Grounded Hard Negatives Improve Contrastive Code Retrieval\"\n- Backup: \"Correcting Misconceptions in Hard Negative Mining for Code: Embedding Distance Helps, Structure Helps Conditionally\"\n\n## Venue Fit\n\n1. **EMNLP Main fit**: Empirical analysis + mechanistic insight papers are a strong EMNLP archetype (cf. \"Do Language Models...\" papers). Contribution is understanding, not just a new method.\n2. **NLP audience**: Frame as contrastive learning methodology with code as instantiation. Representation geometry analysis generalizes beyond code.\n3. **Against \"incremental\" criticism**: Paper corrects a misconception + provides mechanistic explanation + introduces new negative mining paradigm. Three contributions, not one marginal improvement.\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n| Concern | Response | Evidence |\n|---------|----------|----------|\n| Only 2 encoders — can you generalize? | n=2 is minimum for interaction claim; we frame as observation with mechanism, not universal law; cross-architecture (decoder vs encoder-decoder) strengthens it | plan_013 (done), m2_full runs |\n| Temperature regime specificity | Ablate τ ∈ {0.05, 0.1, 0.2} | plan_014 |\n| No downstream task evaluation | SWE-bench Lite end-to-end with LLM agent | plan_003 |\n| Static vs dynamic mining confound | Clarify mining is static; add dynamic baseline | plan_015 |\n| CodeQL scalability at larger scale | 0% timeout, 78% Z%, 123 repos; m1_reextract_v2 adds more | plan_006 (done) |\n| Why not compare inference-time graph methods? | Complementary: they navigate at inference, we mine at training. Discuss relationship. | plan_017 |\n| Single benchmark | Add RepoBench-R cross-file retrieval | plan_004 |\n| Statistical significance | Bootstrap 95% CI for all comparisons; full M2 = 9 seeds × 3 strategies × 2 encoders | plan_016, m2_full |\n| \"Complementary signal\" overstatement | Temper: \"conditionally beneficial\" not \"always complementary\" | Writing discipline |\n| Missing related work | RepoFusion, GRACE, GraphCodeBERT, ANCE, curriculum HN mining | Writing task |\n\n## Evidence Status\n\n### Confirmed findings (basis for claims):\n- D017: True embedding mining helps (+2.0pp Qwen, +1.6pp StarCoder) — corrects MVP BM25-proxy artifact\n- D021/neg_difficulty: Qwen pos_sim=0.9855 (saturated), StarCoder pos_sim=0.7985 (healthy); margin differential explains strategy interaction\n- m2_embed_verify (pilot): 3-strategy comparison confirms ranking (embedding > random, dataflow conditional)\n- plan_013 (StarCoder pilot): Confirms cross-encoder pattern — embedding helps both, dataflow helps Qwen only\n- plan_006: CodeQL scalability confirmed at 123-repo scale\n\n### In progress:\n- m2_full_qwen: 9 seeds × 3 strategies (seed 1 running, best R@1=55.3% at step 1000)\n- m2_full_starcoder: 9 seeds × 3 strategies (seed 1 running, R@1=45.4% at step 1000, still improving)\n- m1_reextract_v2: expanded extraction for higher coverage\n\n### Planned (priority order):\n- plan_003: SWE-bench Lite eval (biggest lever for paper strength)\n- plan_014: Temperature ablation (Dream reviewer concern)\n- plan_004: RepoBench-R second benchmark\n- plan_015: Dynamic mining baseline\n- plan_007/008/009: Additional ablations\n\n## Contingency (if full M2 results weaken claims)\n\n### All 18 runs confirm pilot pattern: Best case\n- Full statistical power, paper as framed above\n- Target: EMNLP Main\n\n### Dataflow benefit disappears even for Qwen at full scale: Pivot to 2-claim paper\n- Drop Claim 2 to analysis observation\n- Paper becomes: \"True embedding mining helps (correcting misconception) + CodeQL extraction is practical + representation geometry analysis explains prior contradictions\"\n- Still publishable: correcting misconception + mechanistic analysis is sufficient for EMNLP Main\n\n### Embedding mining also loses advantage at full scale: Major reassessment needed\n- Recheck data pipeline for bugs (full-scale data may have distribution differences)\n- If confirmed: negative result paper — \"Why Hard Negative Mining Doesn't Scale for Code Retrieval\"\n- Discuss with user before committing direction\n\n## Deprecated Claims (with reason)\n\n- ~~\"Embedding-distance hard negatives actively harm code retrieval\"~~ — FALSIFIED by D017. Original evidence (-27pp R@1) was from BM25-proxy negatives incorrectly labeled as embedding_distance in MVP. True embedding mining shows consistent improvement. Preserved here to prevent regression.\n","numLines":113,"startLine":1,"totalLines":113}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FNhx6yfb5eZjFQQ8cDNMJq","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"SWE-bench Lite End-to-End Evaluation\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"3 strategies × best checkpoint on SWE-bench Lite (300), Qwen3.6-27B agent, 测 resolve rate\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"random_resolve_rate\": 0.227,\n7\t      \"embedding_distance_resolve_rate\": 0.25,\n8\t      \"dataflow_aware_resolve_rate\": 0.26,\n9\t      \"embed_vs_random_delta_pp\": 2.3,\n10\t      \"dataflow_vs_random_delta_pp\": 3.3,\n11\t      \"dataflow_vs_embed_delta_pp\": 1.0,\n12\t      \"total_instances\": 300,\n13\t      \"instances_resolved_random\": 68,\n14\t      \"instances_resolved_embed\": 75,\n15\t      \"instances_resolved_dataflow\": 78,\n16\t      \"retrieval_recall1_random\": 0.533,\n17\t      \"retrieval_recall1_embed\": 0.556,\n18\t      \"retrieval_recall1_dataflow\": 0.548\n19\t    },\n20\t    \"tables\": [\n21\t      {\n22\t        \"caption\": \"SWE-bench Lite Resolve Rate by Retrieval Strategy\",\n23\t        \"columns\": [\n24\t          \"Strategy\",\n25\t          \"Resolve_Rate\",\n26\t          \"Delta_vs_Random\",\n27\t          \"Instances_Resolved\"\n28\t        ],\n29\t        \"rows\": [\n30\t          [\n31\t            \"random\",\n32\t            \"22.7%\",\n33\t            \"—\",\n34\t            68\n35\t          ],\n36\t          [\n37\t            \"embedding_distance\",\n38\t            \"25.0%\",\n39\t            \"+2.3pp\",\n40\t            75\n41\t          ],\n42\t          [\n43\t            \"dataflow_aware\",\n44\t            \"26.0%\",\n45\t            \"+3.3pp\",\n46\t            78\n47\t          ]\n48\t        ]\n49\t      }\n50\t    ],\n51\t    \"figures\": [],\n52\t    \"analysis\": \"Resolve rate 提升确认 retrieval 质量改善能传导到实际软件工程任务。Dataflow 策略独立解决了 5 个 random/embed 均失败的 instance（多为跨文件 dataflow 依赖），支持 Claim 2 的条件性收益叙事。 Embed 策略独立解决 3 个（多为同文件内近义函数混淆），支持 Claim 1。\\n\\n\\nbest 档下 retrieval 质量提升能传导到下游 resolve rate。Qwen best checkpoint embedding R@1≈0.556 vs random 0.533， 差值 2.3pp 在 300 实例上对应约 7 个额外正确 retrieval → 其中部分转化为 resolve。 转化率不是 1:1（retrieval 改善不等于 repair 改善，LLM agent 有自身能力上限）， 但 best 档假设转化效率约 30-40%，即 ~7 个额外正确 retrieval 中约 2-3 个转为 resolve。 Dataflow 在 Qwen 上的条件性收益（pilot +0.8pp R@1）进一步贡献约 1pp resolve delta。 总体 swebench_resolve_delta_pp 落在 [2.0, 5.0] 范围的中低段， 因为 retrieval → repair 的衰减是系统性的。SWE-bench Lite 300 实例规模下， 2-3pp 差异虽小但在 best 档下 bootstrap CI 可检测。\\n\"\n53\t  },\n54\t  {\n55\t    \"name\": \"RepoBench-R Cross-File Retrieval Evaluation\",\n56\t    \"description\": \"3 strategies × best checkpoint on RepoBench-R, retrieval-only evaluation\",\n57\t    \"results\": {\n58\t      \"random_recall1\": 0.412,\n59\t      \"embedding_distance_recall1\": 0.431,\n60\t      \"dataflow_aware_recall1\": 0.438,\n61\t      \"random_mrr\": 0.508,\n62\t      \"embedding_distance_mrr\": 0.529,\n63\t      \"dataflow_aware_mrr\": 0.534,\n64\t      \"embed_vs_random_R1_delta_pp\": 1.9,\n65\t      \"dataflow_vs_random_R1_delta_pp\": 2.6,\n66\t      \"total_queries\": 1200\n67\t    },\n68\t    \"tables\": [\n69\t      {\n70\t        \"caption\": \"RepoBench-R Retrieval Performance\",\n71\t        \"columns\": [\n72\t          \"Strategy\",\n73\t          \"R@1\",\n74\t          \"R@5\",\n75\t          \"R@10\",\n76\t          \"MRR\"\n77\t        ],\n78\t        \"rows\": [\n79\t          [\n80\t            \"random\",\n81\t            0.412,\n82\t            0.687,\n83\t            0.793,\n84\t            0.508\n85\t          ],\n86\t          [\n87\t            \"embedding_distance\",\n88\t            0.431,\n89\t            0.704,\n90\t            0.808,\n91\t            0.529\n92\t          ],\n93\t          [\n94\t            \"dataflow_aware\",\n95\t            0.438,\n96\t            0.711,\n97\t            0.812,\n98\t            0.534\n99\t          ]\n100\t        ]\n101\t      }\n102\t    ],\n103\t    \"figures\": [],\n104\t    \"analysis\": \"第二 benchmark 确认 SWE-smith 上的发现不是 benchmark-specific artifact。 策略排序一致（dataflow ≥ embed > random），增强论文的 external validity。\\n\\n\\nRepoBench-R 是 cross-file retrieval benchmark，天然偏向有结构依赖的查询（import/call 关系）。 在 best 档下，embedding 改善幅度与 SWE-smith 内部 eval 一致（~2pp）， dataflow 的额外收益在此 benchmark 上可能略大于 SWE-smith（因 RepoBench-R 的 cross-file 性质与 dataflow connectivity 天然对齐），但差异不会很大因为训练数据来自 SWE-smith 而非 RepoBench， 存在 domain gap。整体 R@1 低于 SWE-smith 内部 eval（0.41 vs 0.53）， 因为 pool size 和 query 分布不同。关键是方向一致且差异可检测。\\n\"\n105\t  },\n106\t  {\n107\t    \"name\": \"Embedding vs Random Stratified Analysis\",\n108\t    \"description\": \"按 repo size/complexity 分层，分析 embedding negatives 的收益分布\",\n109\t    \"results\": {\n110\t      \"small_repo_lt50_embed_delta_pp\": 0.8,\n111\t      \"medium_repo_50_200_embed_delta_pp\": 2.1,\n112\t      \"large_repo_200_500_embed_delta_pp\": 2.8,\n113\t      \"xlarge_repo_500plus_embed_delta_pp\": 1.5,\n114\t      \"high_complexity_embed_delta_pp\": 2.9,\n115\t      \"low_complexity_embed_delta_pp\": 1.2,\n116\t      \"correlation_repo_size_vs_delta\": 0.31,\n117\t      \"correlation_complexity_vs_delta\": 0.42\n118\t    },\n119\t    \"tables\": [\n120\t      {\n121\t        \"caption\": \"Embedding Mining Benefit by Repo Tier\",\n122\t        \"columns\": [\n123\t          \"Tier\",\n124\t          \"N_Instances\",\n125\t          \"Embed_R1\",\n126\t          \"Random_R1\",\n127\t          \"Delta_pp\"\n128\t        ],\n129\t        \"rows\": [\n130\t          [\n131\t            \"small (<50)\",\n132\t            500,\n133\t            0.568,\n134\t            0.56,\n135\t            \"+0.8\"\n136\t          ],\n137\t          [\n138\t            \"medium (50-200)\",\n139\t            4096,\n140\t            0.551,\n141\t            0.53,\n142\t            \"+2.1\"\n143\t          ],\n144\t          [\n145\t            \"large (200-500)\",\n146\t            13628,\n147\t            0.542,\n148\t            0.514,\n149\t            \"+2.8\"\n150\t          ],\n151\t          [\n152\t            \"xlarge (500+)\",\n153\t            25949,\n154\t            0.528,\n155\t            0.513,\n156\t            \"+1.5\"\n157\t          ]\n158\t        ]\n159\t      }\n160\t    ],\n161\t    \"figures\": [],\n162\t    \"analysis\": \"收益分布分析提供 practical guidance：embedding mining 对中大型项目最有效， 与表征空间中 near-miss 候选密度的直觉一致。复杂度比 size 更具预测力， 提示 negative mining 策略选择应考虑代码结构特征而非简单规模。\\n\\n\\nbest 档下 embedding mining 普遍有效但收益分布不均。中大型 repo（50-500 files）收益最大， 因为 pool 中有足够多的 near-miss 候选（lexically similar but not gold）， embedding mining 能有效挑选最有信息量的 hard negatives。小型 repo pool 太小、 embedding mining 退化为近似 random；超大型 repo 结构复杂度使得 embedding distance 与 relevance 的相关性下降（太多 \\\"远但相关\\\" 的文件）。Complexity（cyclomatic complexity 或 import depth）比 size 更好地预测 embedding mining 收益， 因为高复杂度代码中相似但无关的文件更多。\\n\"\n163\t  },\n164\t  {\n165\t    \"name\": \"Hop Distance Ablation\",\n166\t    \"description\": \"1-hop vs 2-hop vs 3-hop call-graph bounding for dataflow extraction\",\n167\t    \"results\": {\n168\t      \"hop1_connected_rate\": 0.12,\n169\t      \"hop2_connected_rate\": 0.34,\n170\t      \"hop3_connected_rate\": 0.58,\n171\t      \"hop1_z_pct\": 0.18,\n172\t      \"hop2_z_pct\": 0.41,\n173\t      \"hop3_z_pct\": 0.62,\n174\t      \"hop2_qwen_R1\": 0.548,\n175\t      \"hop1_qwen_R1\": 0.541,\n176\t      \"hop3_qwen_R1\": 0.544,\n177\t      \"hop2_extraction_time_s\": 8.9,\n178\t      \"hop3_extraction_time_s\": 23.4\n179\t    },\n180\t    \"tables\": [\n181\t      {\n182\t        \"caption\": \"Hop Distance Impact on Extraction and Training\",\n183\t        \"columns\": [\n184\t          \"Hops\",\n185\t          \"Connected_Rate\",\n186\t          \"Z_Pct\",\n187\t          \"Extraction_Time_s\",\n188\t          \"Qwen_R1\"\n189\t        ],\n190\t        \"rows\": [\n191\t          [\n192\t            1,\n193\t            \"12%\",\n194\t            \"18%\",\n195\t            4.2,\n196\t            0.541\n197\t          ],\n198\t          [\n199\t            2,\n200\t            \"34%\",\n201\t            \"41%\",\n202\t            8.9,\n203\t            0.548\n204\t          ],\n205\t          [\n206\t            3,\n207\t            \"58%\",\n208\t            \"62%\",\n209\t            23.4,\n210\t            0.544\n211\t          ]\n212\t        ]\n213\t      }\n214\t    ],\n215\t    \"figures\": [],\n216\t    \"analysis\": \"2-hop 最优确认了设计选择的合理性。3-hop 的 R@1 回落说明过度扩展 connectivity 范围会引入噪声连接，削弱 structural negative 的信息量。\\n\\n\\n2-hop 是 sweet spot。1-hop 太严格：大多数 repo 中直接 dataflow 连接的文件对稀少（12%）， 导致 connected-not-gold set 太小，dataflow negative mining 退化为近似 random。 3-hop 太宽松：58% 的文件对被标记为 connected，negative pool 被过度稀释， 且提取时间增长 2.6x（路径爆炸）。2-hop（当前默认）在 coverage（34%）和 selectivity（Z=41%）之间取得平衡，R@1 最高。这一结果支持 Claim 3 中的 \\\"scope-bounded\\\" 设计选择。\\n\"\n217\t  },\n218\t  {\n219\t    \"name\": \"Training Data Size Scaling\",\n220\t    \"description\": \"1K vs 3K vs 5K training instances, 测 strategy 收益是否随数据量变化\",\n221\t    \"results\": {\n222\t      \"1k_random_R1\": 0.498,\n223\t      \"1k_embed_R1\": 0.521,\n224\t      \"1k_dataflow_R1\": 0.518,\n225\t      \"3k_random_R1\": 0.525,\n226\t      \"3k_embed_R1\": 0.548,\n227\t      \"3k_dataflow_R1\": 0.543,\n228\t      \"5k_random_R1\": 0.533,\n229\t      \"5k_embed_R1\": 0.556,\n230\t      \"5k_dataflow_R1\": 0.548,\n231\t      \"embed_delta_1k\": 2.3,\n232\t      \"embed_delta_3k\": 2.3,\n233\t      \"embed_delta_5k\": 2.3,\n234\t      \"dataflow_delta_1k\": 2.0,\n235\t      \"dataflow_delta_3k\": 1.8,\n236\t      \"dataflow_delta_5k\": 1.5\n237\t    },\n238\t    \"tables\": [\n239\t      {\n240\t        \"caption\": \"Strategy Benefit by Training Data Size\",\n241\t        \"columns\": [\n242\t          \"Size\",\n243\t          \"Random_R1\",\n244\t          \"Embed_R1\",\n245\t          \"Embed_Delta\",\n246\t          \"Dataflow_R1\",\n247\t          \"DF_Delta\"\n248\t        ],\n249\t        \"rows\": [\n250\t          [\n251\t            \"1K\",\n252\t            0.498,\n253\t            0.521,\n254\t            \"+2.3\",\n255\t            0.518,\n256\t            \"+2.0\"\n257\t          ],\n258\t          [\n259\t            \"3K\",\n260\t            0.525,\n261\t            0.548,\n262\t            \"+2.3\",\n263\t            0.543,\n264\t            \"+1.8\"\n265\t          ],\n266\t          [\n267\t            \"5K\",\n268\t            0.533,\n269\t            0.556,\n270\t            \"+2.3\",\n271\t            0.548,\n272\t            \"+1.5\"\n273\t          ]\n274\t        ]\n275\t      }\n276\t    ],\n277\t    \"figures\": [],\n278\t    \"analysis\": \"Embedding mining 收益的 scale-invariance 强化 Claim 1（普遍有效）。 Dataflow 收益的轻微递减可解释为 \\\"structural signal 被 larger random samples 部分替代\\\"， 但不消失——支持 Claim 2 的 \\\"conditional benefit\\\" 定位。\\n\\n\\nbest 档下 embedding mining 的收益对数据量 robust（~2.3pp 几乎不变）， 因为 embedding distance 提供的信息增益是 strategy-intrinsic 的，不依赖数据量。 Dataflow 收益随数据量增加略有递减（2.0→1.5pp），因为更多数据使 random baseline 也能隐式覆盖部分结构相关的 hard negatives（大数定律），缩小了 dataflow 的 marginal 贡献。但即使在 5K 下，dataflow 在 Qwen 上的条件性收益仍然存在。 绝对性能随数据量单调增长但边际递减（符合 neural scaling 预期）。\\n\"\n279\t  },\n280\t  {\n281\t    \"name\": \"Fusion Head Ablation\",\n282\t    \"description\": \"Embedding-only vs structural-features-only vs combined fusion head\",\n283\t    \"results\": {\n284\t      \"embed_only_R1\": 0.556,\n285\t      \"structural_only_R1\": 0.487,\n286\t      \"combined_R1\": 0.549,\n287\t      \"embed_only_vs_combined_delta\": 0.7\n288\t    },\n289\t    \"tables\": [\n290\t      {\n291\t        \"caption\": \"Fusion Head Comparison (Qwen, best checkpoint)\",\n292\t        \"columns\": [\n293\t          \"Head\",\n294\t          \"R@1\",\n295\t          \"R@5\",\n296\t          \"Note\"\n297\t        ],\n298\t        \"rows\": [\n299\t          [\n300\t            \"embed_only\",\n301\t            0.556,\n302\t            0.961,\n303\t            \"Our default\"\n304\t          ],\n305\t          [\n306\t            \"structural_only\",\n307\t            0.487,\n308\t            0.872,\n309\t            \"Below random baseline\"\n310\t          ],\n311\t          [\n312\t            \"combined\",\n313\t            0.549,\n314\t            0.958,\n315\t            \"Marginal degradation vs embed_only\"\n316\t          ]\n317\t        ]\n318\t      }\n319\t    ],\n320\t    \"figures\": [],\n321\t    \"analysis\": \"Ablation 清晰区分了 structural information 的两种使用方式：training-time mining（有效） vs inference-time feature（无效或有害）。这是对 inference-time graph methods （CodexGraph, LocAgent）的重要区分点，支持 plan_017 的讨论。\\n\\n\\nbest 档下的核心发现是 embedding-only 已经很强（因为我们的方法是 training-time mining 而非 inference-time fusion）。Structural-features-only 单独很弱（R@1=0.487， 低于 random baseline 的 0.533），说明结构信息不能替代语义相似度，只能补充。 Combined fusion head 反而比 embed-only 略低（0.549 vs 0.556），因为加入 structural features 作为 inference-time signal 引入噪声（CodeQL extraction 覆盖率仅 34%， inference 时 missing features 是常态）。这一结果强化论文叙事：结构信息的价值在于 training-time negative mining（改善表征学习），而非 inference-time feature。\\n\"\n322\t  },\n323\t  {\n324\t    \"name\": \"Dataflow-Distance Weighted Negatives\",\n325\t    \"description\": \"Binary connected/disconnected vs dataflow-distance weighted negative sampling\",\n326\t    \"results\": {\n327\t      \"binary_qwen_R1\": 0.548,\n328\t      \"weighted_qwen_R1\": 0.551,\n329\t      \"binary_starcoder_R1\": 0.489,\n330\t      \"weighted_starcoder_R1\": 0.49,\n331\t      \"weighted_vs_binary_qwen_delta\": 0.3,\n332\t      \"weighted_vs_binary_starcoder_delta\": 0.1\n333\t    },\n334\t    \"tables\": [\n335\t      {\n336\t        \"caption\": \"Binary vs Weighted Dataflow Negatives\",\n337\t        \"columns\": [\n338\t          \"Method\",\n339\t          \"Qwen_R1\",\n340\t          \"StarCoder_R1\"\n341\t        ],\n342\t        \"rows\": [\n343\t          [\n344\t            \"binary (default)\",\n345\t            0.548,\n346\t            0.489\n347\t          ],\n348\t          [\n349\t            \"distance-weighted\",\n350\t            0.551,\n351\t            0.49\n352\t          ]\n353\t        ]\n354\t      }\n355\t    ],\n356\t    \"figures\": [],\n357\t    \"analysis\": \"Binary 简单且接近最优，weighted 的微弱改善不足以 justify 额外复杂度。 这一 negative result 反而简化了方法描述——\\\"disconnected = hard negative\\\" 无需更复杂的定义。\\n\\n\\nDistance-weighted sampling 对 Qwen 有微弱额外收益（+0.3pp），因为在饱和空间中 更细粒度的 difficulty gradation 提供略好的 curriculum 效果——离 gold 越远的 disconnected file 越 \\\"easy\\\"，给予更低采样权重，让训练集中在 hard disconnected 上。 但差异很小因为 binary 已经是一个合理的 proxy（connected vs disconnected 的 distinction 捕获了主要信号）。StarCoder 上差异可忽略，与 Claim 2 一致—— dataflow 信号在非饱和空间中 marginal，更细的 granularity 自然也 marginal。 总体结论：binary 足够，weighted 是 diminishing return。\\n\"\n358\t  },\n359\t  {\n360\t    \"name\": \"SWE-bench Failure Analysis\",\n361\t    \"description\": \"50 个 SweRank/BM25 failures，按 dataflow 是否 help 分类\",\n362\t    \"results\": {\n363\t      \"total_failures_analyzed\": 50,\n364\t      \"dataflow_helps_count\": 18,\n365\t      \"dataflow_helps_pct\": 36,\n366\t      \"failure_categories\": {\n367\t        \"cross_file_dependency\": 14,\n368\t        \"same_file_semantic\": 12,\n369\t        \"missing_context\": 10,\n370\t        \"llm_reasoning_failure\": 8,\n371\t        \"other\": 6\n372\t      },\n373\t      \"dataflow_helps_by_category\": {\n374\t        \"cross_file_dependency\": 11,\n375\t        \"same_file_semantic\": 3,\n376\t        \"missing_context\": 3,\n377\t        \"llm_reasoning_failure\": 1,\n378\t        \"other\": 0\n379\t      }\n380\t    },\n381\t    \"tables\": [\n382\t      {\n383\t        \"caption\": \"Failure Analysis: Where Dataflow Helps\",\n384\t        \"columns\": [\n385\t          \"Category\",\n386\t          \"Count\",\n387\t          \"DF_Helps\",\n388\t          \"DF_Help_Rate\"\n389\t        ],\n390\t        \"rows\": [\n391\t          [\n392\t            \"cross_file_dependency\",\n393\t            14,\n394\t            11,\n395\t            \"79%\"\n396\t          ],\n397\t          [\n398\t            \"same_file_semantic\",\n399\t            12,\n400\t            3,\n401\t            \"25%\"\n402\t          ],\n403\t          [\n404\t            \"missing_context\",\n405\t            10,\n406\t            3,\n407\t            \"30%\"\n408\t          ],\n409\t          [\n410\t            \"llm_reasoning_failure\",\n411\t            8,\n412\t            1,\n413\t            \"12%\"\n414\t          ],\n415\t          [\n416\t            \"other\",\n417\t            6,\n418\t            0,\n419\t            \"0%\"\n420\t          ]\n421\t        ]\n422\t      }\n423\t    ],\n424\t    \"figures\": [],\n425\t    \"analysis\": \"Dataflow 最大价值在 cross-file dependency failures（79% help rate）， 精确对齐了 Claim 2 的 \\\"structural dimension the encoder cannot separate via text alone\\\" 叙事。\\n\\n\\n36% 的 BM25/SweRank failure 中 dataflow mining 能提供帮助——这些 case 主要是 cross-file dependency 类型（gold file 与 query file 有 dataflow 连接但 lexical similarity 低）。这个比例与 Z%=41%（connected-not-gold rate）高度一致： 如果 ~40% 的 instances 有 structural signal 可利用，那么在 failures 中 dataflow helps 的比例也应在类似量级。Same-file semantic failures 中 dataflow 偶尔帮助（因为相同文件内的函数调用也被 dataflow graph 捕获），但这不是主要机制。 LLM reasoning failures 与 retrieval 无关，dataflow 自然无法帮助。\\n\"\n426\t  },\n427\t  {\n428\t    \"name\": \"Qualitative Case Studies\",\n429\t    \"description\": \"5-10 个 structural negatives 改变 retrieval outcome 的代表性 case\",\n430\t    \"results\": {\n431\t      \"total_cases\": 8,\n432\t      \"categories\": {\n433\t        \"import_chain_recovery\": 3,\n434\t        \"utility_vs_core_disambiguation\": 2,\n435\t        \"test_file_suppression\": 2,\n436\t        \"config_dependency_detection\": 1\n437\t      }\n438\t    },\n439\t    \"tables\": [],\n440\t    \"figures\": [],\n441\t    \"analysis\": \"Case studies 提供 mechanistic evidence 的具体实例化，让 reviewer 直观理解 \\\"structural dimension\\\" 到底意味着什么。选择覆盖四种不同模式以展示 generality。\\n\\n\\nbest 档下可以找到 8 个 clean case studies，覆盖四种典型模式。 Import chain recovery 最多（3 个），因为这是 dataflow connectivity 最直接的信号类型： gold file 通过 import chain 与 query file 连接，但 lexical similarity 很低（不同功能模块）， random/embed mining 无法区分 \\\"lexically similar but structurally irrelevant\\\" negatives。 Utility vs core disambiguation（2 个）展示 dataflow 如何将 utils.py 类文件正确 判断为 connected（有 dataflow 到 core 的数据流）而非 false negative。 Test file suppression（2 个）展示 test files 虽 lexically similar 但 dataflow disconnected，被正确降权。\\n\"\n442\t  },\n443\t  {\n444\t    \"name\": \"Temperature Ablation\",\n445\t    \"description\": \"τ ∈ {0.05, 0.1, 0.2} × 3 strategies × Qwen, 测 regime-specificity\",\n446\t    \"results\": {\n447\t      \"tau_005\": {\n448\t        \"random_R1\": 0.518,\n449\t        \"embed_R1\": 0.542,\n450\t        \"dataflow_R1\": 0.539,\n451\t        \"embed_delta\": 2.4,\n452\t        \"dataflow_delta\": 2.1\n453\t      },\n454\t      \"tau_010\": {\n455\t        \"random_R1\": 0.533,\n456\t        \"embed_R1\": 0.556,\n457\t        \"dataflow_R1\": 0.548,\n458\t        \"embed_delta\": 2.3,\n459\t        \"dataflow_delta\": 1.5\n460\t      },\n461\t      \"tau_020\": {\n462\t        \"random_R1\": 0.521,\n463\t        \"embed_R1\": 0.539,\n464\t        \"dataflow_R1\": 0.53,\n465\t        \"embed_delta\": 1.8,\n466\t        \"dataflow_delta\": 0.9\n467\t      },\n468\t      \"optimal_tau\": 0.1,\n469\t      \"embed_benefit_robust_across_tau\": true,\n470\t      \"dataflow_benefit_strongest_at_low_tau\": true\n471\t    },\n472\t    \"tables\": [\n473\t      {\n474\t        \"caption\": \"Temperature × Strategy Interaction (Qwen)\",\n475\t        \"columns\": [\n476\t          \"τ\",\n477\t          \"Random_R1\",\n478\t          \"Embed_R1\",\n479\t          \"Embed_Δ\",\n480\t          \"DF_R1\",\n481\t          \"DF_Δ\"\n482\t        ],\n483\t        \"rows\": [\n484\t          [\n485\t            0.05,\n486\t            0.518,\n487\t            0.542,\n488\t            \"+2.4\",\n489\t            0.539,\n490\t            \"+2.1\"\n491\t          ],\n492\t          [\n493\t            0.1,\n494\t            0.533,\n495\t            0.556,\n496\t            \"+2.3\",\n497\t            0.548,\n498\t            \"+1.5\"\n499\t          ],\n500\t          [\n501\t            0.2,\n502\t            0.521,\n503\t            0.539,\n504\t            \"+1.8\",\n505\t            0.53,\n506\t            \"+0.9\"\n507\t          ]\n508\t        ]\n509\t      }\n510\t    ],\n511\t    \"figures\": [],\n512\t    \"analysis\": \"Temperature 消融排除了 \\\"finding is τ-specific\\\" 的 reviewer concern。 Embedding benefit 对 τ robust；dataflow benefit 在低 τ 下最强， 提供 practitioner guidance（如果 encoder 空间饱和 + 低温度 → dataflow 最有价值）。\\n\\n\\nbest 档下 embedding mining 在所有 τ 值下均有正收益（1.8-2.4pp），确认 Claim 1 的 robustness。τ=0.1 是 sweet spot（pilot 已用的值），R@1 最高。τ=0.05 过低导致 contrastive loss landscape 太 sharp，所有 strategy 绝对性能下降但 relative ranking 不变。 τ=0.2 过高使 loss 过于平滑，strategy 差异缩小。Dataflow 收益随 τ 增大而递减 （2.1→1.5→0.9pp），因为高温度下 contrastive loss 对 hard vs easy negatives 的 区分度降低，structural difficulty gradient 被稀释。这一发现提供了 mechanistic insight： dataflow 的 value proposition 是提供更 hard 的 negatives， 而 temperature 控制了 model 对 hardness 的敏感度。\\n\"\n513\t  },\n514\t  {\n515\t    \"name\": \"Dynamic Embedding Mining Baseline\",\n516\t    \"description\": \"每 epoch 重新 mine embedding negatives vs 静态一次性 mine，隔离 selection criterion 和 curriculum shift\",\n517\t    \"results\": {\n518\t      \"static_embed_R1\": 0.556,\n519\t      \"dynamic_embed_R1\": 0.561,\n520\t      \"dynamic_vs_static_delta\": 0.5,\n521\t      \"dynamic_dataflow_R1\": 0.552,\n522\t      \"static_dataflow_R1\": 0.548,\n523\t      \"dynamic_training_time_multiplier\": 2.8\n524\t    },\n525\t    \"tables\": [\n526\t      {\n527\t        \"caption\": \"Static vs Dynamic Mining\",\n528\t        \"columns\": [\n529\t          \"Mining\",\n530\t          \"Strategy\",\n531\t          \"R1\",\n532\t          \"Training_Time_h\"\n533\t        ],\n534\t        \"rows\": [\n535\t          [\n536\t            \"static\",\n537\t            \"embedding\",\n538\t            0.556,\n539\t            3.2\n540\t          ],\n541\t          [\n542\t            \"dynamic\",\n543\t            \"embedding\",\n544\t            0.561,\n545\t            9.0\n546\t          ],\n547\t          [\n548\t            \"static\",\n549\t            \"dataflow\",\n550\t            0.548,\n551\t            3.2\n552\t          ],\n553\t          [\n554\t            \"dynamic\",\n555\t            \"dataflow\",\n556\t            0.552,\n557\t            9.0\n558\t          ]\n559\t        ]\n560\t      }\n561\t    ],\n562\t    \"figures\": [],\n563\t    \"analysis\": \"Static mining 在成本效益上远优于 dynamic。更重要的是，排除了 curriculum confound： embedding mining 的收益来自 selection criterion 本身（挑到 truly hard negatives）， 而非 training dynamics。\\n\\n\\nDynamic mining 提供微弱改善（+0.5pp），因为随训练进行 encoder representation 会 drift， 重新 mine 能保持 negatives 的 hardness。但差异很小（<1pp），说明 static mining 在 3 epoch 短训练中 drift 不严重——pretrained encoder 的 representation 在 LoRA fine-tune 中变化有限（LoRA rank=16，参数量仅为全量的 0.3%）。 关键发现：static vs dynamic 的差异远小于 strategy 差异（embed vs random = 2.3pp vs dynamic vs static = 0.5pp），确认 selection criterion（embedding distance vs random） 是 primary driver，而非 curriculum shift。这排除了 \\\"embed helps only because of implicit curriculum\\\" 的 alternative explanation。 Dynamic 的 2.8x 训练时间开销使其不实用。\\n\"\n564\t  },\n565\t  {\n566\t    \"name\": \"Bootstrap CI for SWE-bench Lite\",\n567\t    \"description\": \"9-seed × 3 strategies 的 bootstrap 95% CI for resolve rate\",\n568\t    \"results\": {\n569\t      \"random_resolve_mean\": 0.227,\n570\t      \"random_resolve_ci\": [\n571\t        0.195,\n572\t        0.259\n573\t      ],\n574\t      \"embed_resolve_mean\": 0.25,\n575\t      \"embed_resolve_ci\": [\n576\t        0.218,\n577\t        0.282\n578\t      ],\n579\t      \"dataflow_resolve_mean\": 0.26,\n580\t      \"dataflow_resolve_ci\": [\n581\t        0.226,\n582\t        0.294\n583\t      ],\n584\t      \"embed_vs_random_delta_mean\": 2.3,\n585\t      \"embed_vs_random_delta_ci\": [\n586\t        0.4,\n587\t        4.2\n588\t      ],\n589\t      \"embed_vs_random_p_value\": 0.012,\n590\t      \"dataflow_vs_random_delta_ci\": [\n591\t        0.5,\n592\t        5.8\n593\t      ],\n594\t      \"dataflow_vs_random_p_value\": 0.008,\n595\t      \"bootstrap_iterations\": 10000\n596\t    },\n597\t    \"tables\": [\n598\t      {\n599\t        \"caption\": \"Bootstrap 95% CI for SWE-bench Lite Resolve Rate\",\n600\t        \"columns\": [\n601\t          \"Comparison\",\n602\t          \"Delta_pp\",\n603\t          \"95% CI\",\n604\t          \"p_value\",\n605\t          \"Significant\"\n606\t        ],\n607\t        \"rows\": [\n608\t          [\n609\t            \"embed vs random\",\n610\t            \"+2.3\",\n611\t            \"[0.4, 4.2]\",\n612\t            0.012,\n613\t            \"Yes\"\n614\t          ],\n615\t          [\n616\t            \"dataflow vs random\",\n617\t            \"+3.3\",\n618\t            \"[0.5, 5.8]\",\n619\t            0.008,\n620\t            \"Yes\"\n621\t          ],\n622\t          [\n623\t            \"dataflow vs embed\",\n624\t            \"+1.0\",\n625\t            \"[-0.8, 2.8]\",\n626\t            0.134,\n627\t            \"No\"\n628\t          ]\n629\t        ]\n630\t      }\n631\t    ],\n632\t    \"figures\": [],\n633\t    \"analysis\": \"Embed vs random 和 dataflow vs random 均显著，但 dataflow vs embed 不显著 （CI 含零）。这精确对应 Claim 2 的 \\\"conditional\\\" 定位——dataflow 相对 random 有显著收益 但相对 embed 的 incremental 在 300 instances 上力度不足。论文可如实报告此 pattern 并讨论 statistical power limitation。\\n\\n\\n300 instances × 9 seeds 提供足够的 bootstrap 统计量力。best 档下 embed_vs_random 的 95% CI 不含零（[0.4, 4.2]pp），p=0.012，通过显著性检验。 CI 宽度 ~4pp 反映 SWE-bench 300 的固有 variance（每个 instance 是 binary outcome， binomial variance 较大）。9 seeds 降低了 training variance 的贡献， 但 evaluation set size（300）是 CI 宽度的主要 bottleneck。 Cross-seed R@1 标准差 ~1.0pp（在 [0.5, 1.5] 范围内）， 确认 training 方差可控。Dataflow CI 也不含零但上界更宽（[0.5, 5.8]）， 反映条件性收益的 inherent higher variance。\\n\"\n634\t  },\n635\t  {\n636\t    \"name\": \"Inference-Time Graph Method Comparison Discussion\",\n637\t    \"description\": \"与 CodexGraph, LocAgent 等 inference-time graph methods 的概念对比与定位\",\n638\t    \"results\": {\n639\t      \"comparison_dimensions\": 4,\n640\t      \"structfuse_strengths\": [\n641\t        \"training-time, no inference overhead\",\n642\t        \"model-agnostic mining\",\n643\t        \"compatible with any retriever\"\n644\t      ],\n645\t      \"inference_methods_strengths\": [\n646\t        \"dynamic graph, adapts to query\",\n647\t        \"no precomputation needed\",\n648\t        \"can leverage runtime call stacks\"\n649\t      ],\n650\t      \"complementarity_score\": \"high\",\n651\t      \"empirical_comparison\": \"not applicable (different paradigm)\"\n652\t    },\n653\t    \"tables\": [\n654\t      {\n655\t        \"caption\": \"Training-Time vs Inference-Time Structural Methods\",\n656\t        \"columns\": [\n657\t          \"Dimension\",\n658\t          \"StructFuse\",\n659\t          \"CodexGraph_LocAgent\"\n660\t        ],\n661\t        \"rows\": [\n662\t          [\n663\t            \"Signal injection\",\n664\t            \"Training (negative mining)\",\n665\t            \"Inference (graph navigation)\"\n666\t          ],\n667\t          [\n668\t            \"Inference overhead\",\n669\t            \"Zero\",\n670\t            \"Per-query graph traversal\"\n671\t          ],\n672\t          [\n673\t            \"Graph freshness\",\n674\t            \"Static (pretrained)\",\n675\t            \"Dynamic (query-adaptive)\"\n676\t          ],\n677\t          [\n678\t            \"Compatibility\",\n679\t            \"Any contrastive retriever\",\n680\t            \"Specific agent framework\"\n681\t          ]\n682\t        ]\n683\t      }\n684\t    ],\n685\t    \"figures\": [],\n686\t    \"analysis\": \"清晰定位避免了 \\\"why not compare with X\\\" 的 reviewer 质疑。 Complementarity framing 开启了 future work 方向（combine training-time mining + inference-time navigation）。\\n\\n\\n这是 discussion section 的概念分析而非实验。best 档下不需要实际跑 inference-time baselines（GPU budget=0），而是提供清晰的 taxonomy：StructFuse 是 training-time structural signal injection（改善表征学习），inference-time methods 是 navigation-time structural signal（改善检索路径）。两者 complementary 而非 competitive。 核心区别：StructFuse 是 offline（一次 mine、反复 train），inference methods 是 online（每次 query 重新构建 graph）。StructFuse 的 overhead 在 training 时 已 amortize，inference 零成本；inference methods 每次 query 有额外延迟。 但 inference methods 能适应 query-specific context（如运行时调用栈），StructFuse 不能。\\n\"\n687\t  },\n688\t  {\n689\t    \"name\": \"M2 Full Qwen 9-Seed Results\",\n690\t    \"description\": \"9 seeds × 3 strategies, Qwen2.5-Coder-3B, 全量 3-strategy 对比\",\n691\t    \"results\": {\n692\t      \"random_mean_R1\": 0.533,\n693\t      \"random_std_R1\": 0.008,\n694\t      \"random_seeds\": [\n695\t        0.527,\n696\t        0.53,\n697\t        0.531,\n698\t        0.533,\n699\t        0.534,\n700\t        0.535,\n701\t        0.536,\n702\t        0.538,\n703\t        0.54\n704\t      ],\n705\t      \"embedding_mean_R1\": 0.556,\n706\t      \"embedding_std_R1\": 0.009,\n707\t      \"embedding_seeds\": [\n708\t        0.547,\n709\t        0.55,\n710\t        0.553,\n711\t        0.555,\n712\t        0.556,\n713\t        0.558,\n714\t        0.559,\n715\t        0.561,\n716\t        0.564\n717\t      ],\n718\t      \"dataflow_mean_R1\": 0.548,\n719\t      \"dataflow_std_R1\": 0.01,\n720\t      \"dataflow_seeds\": [\n721\t        0.538,\n722\t        0.541,\n723\t        0.544,\n724\t        0.547,\n725\t        0.548,\n726\t        0.55,\n727\t        0.552,\n728\t        0.555,\n729\t        0.558\n730\t      ],\n731\t      \"embed_vs_random_delta_pp\": 2.3,\n732\t      \"dataflow_vs_random_delta_pp\": 1.5,\n733\t      \"dataflow_vs_embed_delta_pp\": -0.8,\n734\t      \"embed_vs_random_bootstrap_p\": 0.003,\n735\t      \"dataflow_vs_random_bootstrap_p\": 0.018,\n736\t      \"cross_seed_R1_std_max\": 1.0,\n737\t      \"best_checkpoint_step\": 1000,\n738\t      \"step_1000_overfitting\": \"controlled via early stopping at step 500-1000\"\n739\t    },\n740\t    \"tables\": [\n741\t      {\n742\t        \"caption\": \"M2 Full Qwen: 9-Seed Summary\",\n743\t        \"columns\": [\n744\t          \"Strategy\",\n745\t          \"Mean_R1\",\n746\t          \"Std_R1\",\n747\t          \"95% CI\",\n748\t          \"Best_Step\"\n749\t        ],\n750\t        \"rows\": [\n751\t          [\n752\t            \"random\",\n753\t            0.533,\n754\t            0.008,\n755\t            \"[0.527, 0.539]\",\n756\t            1000\n757\t          ],\n758\t          [\n759\t            \"embedding_distance\",\n760\t            0.556,\n761\t            0.009,\n762\t            \"[0.549, 0.563]\",\n763\t            1000\n764\t          ],\n765\t          [\n766\t            \"dataflow_aware\",\n767\t            0.548,\n768\t            0.01,\n769\t            \"[0.540, 0.556]\",\n770\t            \"500-1000\"\n771\t          ]\n772\t        ]\n773\t      }\n774\t    ],\n775\t    \"figures\": [],\n776\t    \"analysis\": \"9-seed 全量结果是论文的 primary evidence for Claims 1 & 2。 Embedding > random 的 p=0.003 提供强统计支持。 Dataflow > random 的 p=0.018 提供充分支持但力度略弱（higher variance）， 精确对应 \\\"conditional benefit\\\" 叙事。\\n\\n\\nPilot 数据（单 seed）显示 random=0.5357, embed=0.5557, dataflow=0.5436。 best 档下 9-seed 平均值保持一致趋势但因 seed variance 略有修正。 Qwen pos_sim=0.9855 的饱和空间使 random negatives 太 easy（margin=0.074）， embedding mining 有效因为挑选 harder negatives（margin=0.017）。 Dataflow 的条件性收益（+1.5pp vs random）通过更 hard 的 structural negatives 进一步压缩 margin（margin=0.029），但 incremental 小于 embed 因为 embedding distance 已经捕获了大部分 difficulty gradient。Cross-seed std ~0.8-1.0pp， 在 [0.5, 1.5] 范围内，说明 training 方差可控。Step 1000 过拟合通过 early stopping at best validation loss 解决，不影响结论。\\n\"\n777\t  },\n778\t  {\n779\t    \"name\": \"M2 Full StarCoder 9-Seed Results\",\n780\t    \"description\": \"9 seeds × 3 strategies, StarCoder2-3B, 全量交互效应验证\",\n781\t    \"results\": {\n782\t      \"random_mean_R1\": 0.49,\n783\t      \"random_std_R1\": 0.009,\n784\t      \"embedding_mean_R1\": 0.507,\n785\t      \"embedding_std_R1\": 0.01,\n786\t      \"dataflow_mean_R1\": 0.488,\n787\t      \"dataflow_std_R1\": 0.011,\n788\t      \"embed_vs_random_delta_pp\": 1.7,\n789\t      \"dataflow_vs_random_delta_pp\": -0.2,\n790\t      \"embed_vs_random_bootstrap_p\": 0.008,\n791\t      \"dataflow_vs_random_bootstrap_p\": 0.62,\n792\t      \"cross_seed_R1_std_max\": 1.1\n793\t    },\n794\t    \"tables\": [\n795\t      {\n796\t        \"caption\": \"M2 Full StarCoder: 9-Seed Summary\",\n797\t        \"columns\": [\n798\t          \"Strategy\",\n799\t          \"Mean_R1\",\n800\t          \"Std_R1\",\n801\t          \"95% CI\",\n802\t          \"p_vs_random\"\n803\t        ],\n804\t        \"rows\": [\n805\t          [\n806\t            \"random\",\n807\t            0.49,\n808\t            0.009,\n809\t            \"[0.483, 0.497]\",\n810\t            \"—\"\n811\t          ],\n812\t          [\n813\t            \"embedding_distance\",\n814\t            0.507,\n815\t            0.01,\n816\t            \"[0.499, 0.515]\",\n817\t            0.008\n818\t          ],\n819\t          [\n820\t            \"dataflow_aware\",\n821\t            0.488,\n822\t            0.011,\n823\t            \"[0.479, 0.497]\",\n824\t            0.62\n825\t          ]\n826\t        ]\n827\t      }\n828\t    ],\n829\t    \"figures\": [],\n830\t    \"analysis\": \"StarCoder 的 clean null result for dataflow 是论文 strongest mechanistic evidence。 两编码器的交互效应 pattern（embed always helps, dataflow conditional on saturation） 完美对应表征空间几何学解释。\\n\\nStarCoder pos_sim=0.7985（健康空间），random negatives 已提供足够 difficulty gradient （margin=0.194）。Embedding mining 仍然有效（+1.7pp, p=0.008），因为 embedding distance 选择的 negatives 更 informative regardless of space geometry——这是 Claim 1 的关键证据 （两个编码器均显著）。Dataflow 在 StarCoder 上无显著差异（-0.2pp, p=0.62）， 产生干净的交互效应：dataflow 的 structural negatives 在非饱和空间中不提供 beyond-embedding 的信息增量，因为 encoder 已能通过 text alone 区分结构上不同的文件。 这一 null result 是论文 mechanistic story 的关键支撑—— 不是所有方法在所有条件下都有效，而是有清晰的条件边界。\\n\"\n831\t  }\n832\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0e74a8f6-0a91-487b-9437-3d2c0cc79eae","uuid":"22bb3768-1310-4455-befe-143b2f2abcb8","timestamp":"2026-05-14T08:11:51.505Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/structfuse-context/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T075732/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SWE-bench Lite End-to-End Evaluation\",\n    \"description\": \"3 strategies × best checkpoint on SWE-bench Lite (300), Qwen3.6-27B agent, 测 resolve rate\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"random_resolve_rate\": 0.227,\n      \"embedding_distance_resolve_rate\": 0.25,\n      \"dataflow_aware_resolve_rate\": 0.26,\n      \"embed_vs_random_delta_pp\": 2.3,\n      \"dataflow_vs_random_delta_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"dataflow_vs_embed_delta_pp\": 1.0,\n      \"total_instances\": 300,\n      \"instances_resolved_random\": 68,\n      \"instances_resolved_embed\": 75,\n      \"instances_resolved_dataflow\": 78,\n      \"retrieval_recall1_random\": 0.533,\n      \"retrieval_recall1_embed\": 0.556,\n      \"retrieval_recall1_dataflow\": 0.548\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"SWE-bench Lite Resolve Rate by Retrieval Strategy\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Strategy\",\n          \"Resolve_Rate\",\n          \"Delta_vs_Random\",\n          \"Instances_Resolved\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"random\",\n            \"22.7%\",\n            \"—\",\n            68\n          ],\n          [\n            \"embedding_distance\",\n            \"25.0%\",\n            \"+2.3pp\",\n            75\n          ],\n          [\n            \"dataflow_aware\",\n            \"26.0%\",\n            \"+3.3pp\",\n            78\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Resolve rate 提升确认 retrieval 质量改善能传导到实际软件工程任务。Dataflow 策略独立解决了 5 个 random/embed 均失败的 instance（多为跨文件 dataflow 依赖），支持 Claim 2 的条件性收益叙事。 Embed 策略独立解决 3 个（多为同文件内近义函数混淆），支持 Claim 1。\\n\\n\\nbest 档下 retrieval 质量提升能传导到下游 resolve rate。Qwen best checkpoint embedding R@1≈0.556 vs random 0.533， 差值 2.3pp 在 300 实例上对应约 7 个额外正确 retrieval → 其中部分转化为 resolve。 转化率不是 1:1（retrieval 改善不等于 repair 改善，LLM agent 有自身能力上限）， 但 best 档假设转化效率约 30-40%，即 ~7 个额外正确 retrieval 中约 2-3 个转为 resolve。 Dataflow 在 Qwen 上的条件性收益（pilot +0.8pp R@1）进一步贡献约 1pp resolve delta。 总体 swebench_resolve_delta_pp 落在 [2.0, 5.0] 范围的中低段， 因为 retrieval → repair 的衰减是系统性的。SWE-bench Lite 300 实例规模下， 2-3pp 差异虽小但在 best 档下 bootstrap CI 可检测。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"RepoBench-R Cross-File Retrieval Evaluation\",\n    \"description\": \"3 strategies × best checkpoint on RepoBench-R, retrieval-only evaluation\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"random_recall1\": 0.412,\n      \"embedding_distance_recall1\": 0.431,\n      \"dataflow_aware_recall1\": 0.438,\n      \"random_mrr\": 0.508,\n      \"embedding_distance_mrr\": 0.529,\n      \"dataflow_aware_mrr\": 0.534,\n      \"embed_vs_random_R1_delta_pp\": 1.9,\n      \"dataflow_vs_random_R1_delta_pp\": 2.6,\n      \"total_queries\": 1200\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"RepoBench-R Retrieval Performance\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Strategy\",\n          \"R@1\",\n          \"R@5\",\n          \"R@10\",\n          \"MRR\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"random\",\n            0.412,\n            0.687,\n            0.793,\n            0.508\n          ],\n          [\n            \"embedding_distance\",\n            0.431,\n            0.704,\n            0.808,\n            0.529\n          ],\n          [\n            \"dataflow_aware\",\n            0.438,\n            0.711,\n            0.812,\n            0.534\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"第二 benchmark 确认 SWE-smith 上的发现不是 benchmark-specific artifact。 策略排序一致（dataflow ≥ embed > random），增强论文的 external validity。\\n\\n\\nRepoBench-R 是 cross-file retrieval benchmark，天然偏向有结构依赖的查询（import/call 关系）。 在 best 档下，embedding 改善幅度与 SWE-smith 内部 eval 一致（~2pp）， dataflow 的额外收益在此 benchmark 上可能略大于 SWE-smith（因 RepoBench-R 的 cross-file 性质与 dataflow connectivity 天然对齐），但差异不会很大因为训练数据来自 SWE-smith 而非 RepoBench， 存在 domain gap。整体 R@1 低于 SWE-smith 内部 eval（0.41 vs 0.53）， 因为 pool size 和 query 分布不同。关键是方向一致且差异可检测。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Embedding vs Random Stratified Analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"按 repo size/complexity 分层，分析 embedding negatives 的收益分布\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"small_repo_lt50_embed_delta_pp\": 0.8,\n      \"medium_repo_50_200_embed_delta_pp\": 2.1,\n      \"large_repo_200_500_embed_delta_pp\": 2.8,\n      \"xlarge_repo_500plus_embed_delta_pp\": 1.5,\n      \"high_complexity_embed_delta_pp\": 2.9,\n      \"low_complexity_embed_delta_pp\": 1.2,\n      \"correlation_repo_size_vs_delta\": 0.31,\n      \"correlation_complexity_vs_delta\": 0.42\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Embedding Mining Benefit by Repo Tier\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Tier\",\n          \"N_Instances\",\n          \"Embed_R1\",\n          \"Random_R1\",\n          \"Delta_pp\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"small (<50)\",\n            500,\n            0.568,\n            0.56,\n            \"+0.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"medium (50-200)\",\n            4096,\n            0.551,\n            0.53,\n            \"+2.1\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"large (200-500)\",\n            13628,\n            0.542,\n            0.514,\n            \"+2.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"xlarge (500+)\",\n            25949,\n            0.528,\n            0.513,\n            \"+1.5\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"收益分布分析提供 practical guidance：embedding mining 对中大型项目最有效， 与表征空间中 near-miss 候选密度的直觉一致。复杂度比 size 更具预测力， 提示 negative mining 策略选择应考虑代码结构特征而非简单规模。\\n\\n\\nbest 档下 embedding mining 普遍有效但收益分布不均。中大型 repo（50-500 files）收益最大， 因为 pool 中有足够多的 near-miss 候选（lexically similar but not gold）， embedding mining 能有效挑选最有信息量的 hard negatives。小型 repo pool 太小、 embedding mining 退化为近似 random；超大型 repo 结构复杂度使得 embedding distance 与 relevance 的相关性下降（太多 \\\"远但相关\\\" 的文件）。Complexity（cyclomatic complexity 或 import depth）比 size 更好地预测 embedding mining 收益， 因为高复杂度代码中相似但无关的文件更多。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Hop Distance Ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"1-hop vs 2-hop vs 3-hop call-graph bounding for dataflow extraction\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"hop1_connected_rate\": 0.12,\n      \"hop2_connected_rate\": 0.34,\n      \"hop3_connected_rate\": 0.58,\n      \"hop1_z_pct\": 0.18,\n      \"hop2_z_pct\": 0.41,\n      \"hop3_z_pct\": 0.62,\n      \"hop2_qwen_R1\": 0.548,\n      \"hop1_qwen_R1\": 0.541,\n      \"hop3_qwen_R1\": 0.544,\n      \"hop2_extraction_time_s\": 8.9,\n      \"hop3_extraction_time_s\": 23.4\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Hop Distance Impact on Extraction and Training\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Hops\",\n          \"Connected_Rate\",\n          \"Z_Pct\",\n          \"Extraction_Time_s\",\n          \"Qwen_R1\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            1,\n            \"12%\",\n            \"18%\",\n            4.2,\n            0.541\n          ],\n          [\n            2,\n            \"34%\",\n            \"41%\",\n            8.9,\n            0.548\n          ],\n          [\n            3,\n            \"58%\",\n            \"62%\",\n            23.4,\n            0.544\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"2-hop 最优确认了设计选择的合理性。3-hop 的 R@1 回落说明过度扩展 connectivity 范围会引入噪声连接，削弱 structural negative 的信息量。\\n\\n\\n2-hop 是 sweet spot。1-hop 太严格：大多数 repo 中直接 dataflow 连接的文件对稀少（12%）， 导致 connected-not-gold set 太小，dataflow negative mining 退化为近似 random。 3-hop 太宽松：58% 的文件对被标记为 connected，negative pool 被过度稀释， 且提取时间增长 2.6x（路径爆炸）。2-hop（当前默认）在 coverage（34%）和 selectivity（Z=41%）之间取得平衡，R@1 最高。这一结果支持 Claim 3 中的 \\\"scope-bounded\\\" 设计选择。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Training Data Size Scaling\",\n    \"description\": \"1K vs 3K vs 5K training instances, 测 strategy 收益是否随数据量变化\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"1k_random_R1\": 0.498,\n      \"1k_embed_R1\": 0.521,\n      \"1k_dataflow_R1\": 0.518,\n      \"3k_random_R1\": 0.525,\n      \"3k_embed_R1\": 0.548,\n      \"3k_dataflow_R1\": 0.543,\n      \"5k_random_R1\": 0.533,\n      \"5k_embed_R1\": 0.556,\n      \"5k_dataflow_R1\": 0.548,\n      \"embed_delta_1k\": 2.3,\n      \"embed_delta_3k\": 2.3,\n      \"embed_delta_5k\": 2.3,\n      \"dataflow_delta_1k\": 2.0,\n      \"dataflow_delta_3k\": 1.8,\n      \"dataflow_delta_5k\": 1.5\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Strategy Benefit by Training Data Size\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Size\",\n          \"Random_R1\",\n          \"Embed_R1\",\n          \"Embed_Delta\",\n          \"Dataflow_R1\",\n          \"DF_Delta\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"1K\",\n            0.498,\n            0.521,\n            \"+2.3\",\n            0.518,\n            \"+2.0\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"3K\",\n            0.525,\n            0.548,\n            \"+2.3\",\n            0.543,\n            \"+1.8\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"5K\",\n            0.533,\n            0.556,\n            \"+2.3\",\n            0.548,\n            \"+1.5\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Embedding mining 收益的 scale-invariance 强化 Claim 1（普遍有效）。 Dataflow 收益的轻微递减可解释为 \\\"structural signal 被 larger random samples 部分替代\\\"， 但不消失——支持 Claim 2 的 \\\"conditional benefit\\\" 定位。\\n\\n\\nbest 档下 embedding mining 的收益对数据量 robust（~2.3pp 几乎不变）， 因为 embedding distance 提供的信息增益是 strategy-intrinsic 的，不依赖数据量。 Dataflow 收益随数据量增加略有递减（2.0→1.5pp），因为更多数据使 random baseline 也能隐式覆盖部分结构相关的 hard negatives（大数定律），缩小了 dataflow 的 marginal 贡献。但即使在 5K 下，dataflow 在 Qwen 上的条件性收益仍然存在。 绝对性能随数据量单调增长但边际递减（符合 neural scaling 预期）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Fusion Head Ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"Embedding-only vs structural-features-only vs combined fusion head\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"embed_only_R1\": 0.556,\n      \"structural_only_R1\": 0.487,\n      \"combined_R1\": 0.549,\n      \"embed_only_vs_combined_delta\": 0.7\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Fusion Head Comparison (Qwen, best checkpoint)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Head\",\n          \"R@1\",\n          \"R@5\",\n          \"Note\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"embed_only\",\n            0.556,\n            0.961,\n            \"Our default\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"structural_only\",\n            0.487,\n            0.872,\n            \"Below random baseline\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"combined\",\n            0.549,\n            0.958,\n            \"Marginal degradation vs embed_only\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Ablation 清晰区分了 structural information 的两种使用方式：training-time mining（有效） vs inference-time feature（无效或有害）。这是对 inference-time graph methods （CodexGraph, LocAgent）的重要区分点，支持 plan_017 的讨论。\\n\\n\\nbest 档下的核心发现是 embedding-only 已经很强（因为我们的方法是 training-time mining 而非 inference-time fusion）。Structural-features-only 单独很弱（R@1=0.487， 低于 random baseline 的 0.533），说明结构信息不能替代语义相似度，只能补充。 Combined fusion head 反而比 embed-only 略低（0.549 vs 0.556），因为加入 structural features 作为 inference-time signal 引入噪声（CodeQL extraction 覆盖率仅 34%， inference 时 missing features 是常态）。这一结果强化论文叙事：结构信息的价值在于 training-time negative mining（改善表征学习），而非 inference-time feature。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Dataflow-Distance Weighted Negatives\",\n    \"description\": \"Binary connected/disconnected vs dataflow-distance weighted negative sampling\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"binary_qwen_R1\": 0.548,\n      \"weighted_qwen_R1\": 0.551,\n      \"binary_starcoder_R1\": 0.489,\n      \"weighted_starcoder_R1\": 0.49,\n      \"weighted_vs_binary_qwen_delta\": 0.3,\n      \"weighted_vs_binary_starcoder_delta\": 0.1\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Binary vs Weighted Dataflow Negatives\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Qwen_R1\",\n          \"StarCoder_R1\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"binary (default)\",\n            0.548,\n            0.489\n          ],\n          [\n            \"distance-weighted\",\n            0.551,\n            0.49\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Binary 简单且接近最优，weighted 的微弱改善不足以 justify 额外复杂度。 这一 negative result 反而简化了方法描述——\\\"disconnected = hard negative\\\" 无需更复杂的定义。\\n\\n\\nDistance-weighted sampling 对 Qwen 有微弱额外收益（+0.3pp），因为在饱和空间中 更细粒度的 difficulty gradation 提供略好的 curriculum 效果——离 gold 越远的 disconnected file 越 \\\"easy\\\"，给予更低采样权重，让训练集中在 hard disconnected 上。 但差异很小因为 binary 已经是一个合理的 proxy（connected vs disconnected 的 distinction 捕获了主要信号）。StarCoder 上差异可忽略，与 Claim 2 一致—— dataflow 信号在非饱和空间中 marginal，更细的 granularity 自然也 marginal。 总体结论：binary 足够，weighted 是 diminishing return。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SWE-bench Failure Analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"50 个 SweRank/BM25 failures，按 dataflow 是否 help 分类\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_failures_analyzed\": 50,\n      \"dataflow_helps_count\": 18,\n      \"dataflow_helps_pct\": 36,\n      \"failure_categories\": {\n        \"cross_file_dependency\": 14,\n        \"same_file_semantic\": 12,\n        \"missing_context\": 10,\n        \"llm_reasoning_failure\": 8,\n        \"other\": 6\n      },\n      \"dataflow_helps_by_category\": {\n        \"cross_file_dependency\": 11,\n        \"same_file_semantic\": 3,\n        \"missing_context\": 3,\n        \"llm_reasoning_failure\": 1,\n        \"other\": 0\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Failure Analysis: Where Dataflow Helps\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Category\",\n          \"Count\",\n          \"DF_Helps\",\n          \"DF_Help_Rate\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"cross_file_dependency\",\n            14,\n            11,\n            \"79%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"same_file_semantic\",\n            12,\n            3,\n            \"25%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"missing_context\",\n            10,\n            3,\n            \"30%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"llm_reasoning_failure\",\n            8,\n            1,\n            \"12%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"other\",\n            6,\n            0,\n            \"0%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Dataflow 最大价值在 cross-file dependency failures（79% help rate）， 精确对齐了 Claim 2 的 \\\"structural dimension the encoder cannot separate via text alone\\\" 叙事。\\n\\n\\n36% 的 BM25/SweRank failure 中 dataflow mining 能提供帮助——这些 case 主要是 cross-file dependency 类型（gold file 与 query file 有 dataflow 连接但 lexical similarity 低）。这个比例与 Z%=41%（connected-not-gold rate）高度一致： 如果 ~40% 的 instances 有 structural signal 可利用，那么在 failures 中 dataflow helps 的比例也应在类似量级。Same-file semantic failures 中 dataflow 偶尔帮助（因为相同文件内的函数调用也被 dataflow graph 捕获），但这不是主要机制。 LLM reasoning failures 与 retrieval 无关，dataflow 自然无法帮助。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Qualitative Case Studies\",\n    \"description\": \"5-10 个 structural negatives 改变 retrieval outcome 的代表性 case\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"total_cases\": 8,\n      \"categories\": {\n        \"import_chain_recovery\": 3,\n        \"utility_vs_core_disambiguation\": 2,\n        \"test_file_suppression\": 2,\n        \"config_dependency_detection\": 1\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Case studies 提供 mechanistic evidence 的具体实例化，让 reviewer 直观理解 \\\"structural dimension\\\" 到底意味着什么。选择覆盖四种不同模式以展示 generality。\\n\\n\\nbest 档下可以找到 8 个 clean case studies，覆盖四种典型模式。 Import chain recovery 最多（3 个），因为这是 dataflow connectivity 最直接的信号类型： gold file 通过 import chain 与 query file 连接，但 lexical similarity 很低（不同功能模块）， random/embed mining 无法区分 \\\"lexically similar but structurally irrelevant\\\" negatives。 Utility vs core disambiguation（2 个）展示 dataflow 如何将 utils.py 类文件正确 判断为 connected（有 dataflow 到 core 的数据流）而非 false negative。 Test file suppression（2 个）展示 test files 虽 lexically similar 但 dataflow disconnected，被正确降权。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Temperature Ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"τ ∈ {0.05, 0.1, 0.2} × 3 strategies × Qwen, 测 regime-specificity\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"tau_005\": {\n        \"random_R1\": 0.518,\n        \"embed_R1\": 0.542,\n        \"dataflow_R1\": 0.539,\n        \"embed_delta\": 2.4,\n        \"dataflow_delta\": 2.1\n      },\n      \"tau_010\": {\n        \"random_R1\": 0.533,\n        \"embed_R1\": 0.556,\n        \"dataflow_R1\": 0.548,\n        \"embed_delta\": 2.3,\n        \"dataflow_delta\": 1.5\n      },\n      \"tau_020\": {\n        \"random_R1\": 0.521,\n        \"embed_R1\": 0.539,\n        \"dataflow_R1\": 0.53,\n        \"embed_delta\": 1.8,\n        \"dataflow_delta\": 0.9\n      },\n      \"optimal_tau\": 0.1,\n      \"embed_benefit_robust_across_tau\": true,\n      \"dataflow_benefit_strongest_at_low_tau\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Temperature × Strategy Interaction (Qwen)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"τ\",\n          \"Random_R1\",\n          \"Embed_R1\",\n          \"Embed_Δ\",\n          \"DF_R1\",\n          \"DF_Δ\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            0.05,\n            0.518,\n            0.542,\n            \"+2.4\",\n            0.539,\n            \"+2.1\"\n          ],\n          [\n            0.1,\n            0.533,\n            0.556,\n            \"+2.3\",\n            0.548,\n            \"+1.5\"\n          ],\n          [\n            0.2,\n            0.521,\n            0.539,\n            \"+1.8\",\n            0.53,\n            \"+0.9\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Temperature 消融排除了 \\\"finding is τ-specific\\\" 的 reviewer concern。 Embedding benefit 对 τ robust；dataflow benefit 在低 τ 下最强， 提供 practitioner guidance（如果 encoder 空间饱和 + 低温度 → dataflow 最有价值）。\\n\\n\\nbest 档下 embedding mining 在所有 τ 值下均有正收益（1.8-2.4pp），确认 Claim 1 的 robustness。τ=0.1 是 sweet spot（pilot 已用的值），R@1 最高。τ=0.05 过低导致 contrastive loss landscape 太 sharp，所有 strategy 绝对性能下降但 relative ranking 不变。 τ=0.2 过高使 loss 过于平滑，strategy 差异缩小。Dataflow 收益随 τ 增大而递减 （2.1→1.5→0.9pp），因为高温度下 contrastive loss 对 hard vs easy negatives 的 区分度降低，structural difficulty gradient 被稀释。这一发现提供了 mechanistic insight： dataflow 的 value proposition 是提供更 hard 的 negatives， 而 temperature 控制了 model 对 hardness 的敏感度。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Dynamic Embedding Mining Baseline\",\n    \"description\": \"每 epoch 重新 mine embedding negatives vs 静态一次性 mine，隔离 selection criterion 和 curriculum shift\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"static_embed_R1\": 0.556,\n      \"dynamic_embed_R1\": 0.561,\n      \"dynamic_vs_static_delta\": 0.5,\n      \"dynamic_dataflow_R1\": 0.552,\n      \"static_dataflow_R1\": 0.548,\n      \"dynamic_training_time_multiplier\": 2.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Static vs Dynamic Mining\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Mining\",\n          \"Strategy\",\n          \"R1\",\n          \"Training_Time_h\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"static\",\n            \"embedding\",\n            0.556,\n            3.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"dynamic\",\n            \"embedding\",\n            0.561,\n            9.0\n          ],\n          [\n            \"static\",\n            \"dataflow\",\n            0.548,\n            3.2\n          ],\n          [\n            \"dynamic\",\n            \"dataflow\",\n            0.552,\n            9.0\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Static mining 在成本效益上远优于 dynamic。更重要的是，排除了 curriculum confound： embedding mining 的收益来自 selection criterion 本身（挑到 truly hard negatives）， 而非 training dynamics。\\n\\n\\nDynamic mining 提供微弱改善（+0.5pp），因为随训练进行 encoder representation 会 drift， 重新 mine 能保持 negatives 的 hardness。但差异很小（<1pp），说明 static mining 在 3 epoch 短训练中 drift 不严重——pretrained encoder 的 representation 在 LoRA fine-tune 中变化有限（LoRA rank=16，参数量仅为全量的 0.3%）。 关键发现：static vs dynamic 的差异远小于 strategy 差异（embed vs random = 2.3pp vs dynamic vs static = 0.5pp），确认 selection criterion（embedding distance vs random） 是 primary driver，而非 curriculum shift。这排除了 \\\"embed helps only because of implicit curriculum\\\" 的 alternative explanation。 Dynamic 的 2.8x 训练时间开销使其不实用。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Bootstrap CI for SWE-bench Lite\",\n    \"description\": \"9-seed × 3 strategies 的 bootstrap 95% CI for resolve rate\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"random_resolve_mean\": 0.227,\n      \"random_resolve_ci\": [\n        0.195,\n        0.259\n      ],\n      \"embed_resolve_mean\": 0.25,\n      \"embed_resolve_ci\": [\n        0.218,\n        0.282\n      ],\n      \"dataflow_resolve_mean\": 0.26,\n      \"dataflow_resolve_ci\": [\n        0.226,\n        0.294\n      ],\n      \"embed_vs_random_delta_mean\": 2.3,\n      \"embed_vs_random_delta_ci\": [\n        0.4,\n        4.2\n      ],\n      \"embed_vs_random_p_value\": 0.012,\n      \"dataflow_vs_random_delta_ci\": [\n        0.5,\n        5.8\n      ],\n      \"dataflow_vs_random_p_value\": 0.008,\n      \"bootstrap_iterations\": 10000\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Bootstrap 95% CI for SWE-bench Lite Resolve Rate\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Comparison\",\n          \"Delta_pp\",\n          \"95% CI\",\n          \"p_value\",\n          \"Significant\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"embed vs random\",\n            \"+2.3\",\n            \"[0.4, 4.2]\",\n            0.012,\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"dataflow vs random\",\n            \"+3.3\",\n            \"[0.5, 5.8]\",\n            0.008,\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"dataflow vs embed\",\n            \"+1.0\",\n            \"[-0.8, 2.8]\",\n            0.134,\n            \"No\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Embed vs random 和 dataflow vs random 均显著，但 dataflow vs embed 不显著 （CI 含零）。这精确对应 Claim 2 的 \\\"conditional\\\" 定位——dataflow 相对 random 有显著收益 但相对 embed 的 incremental 在 300 instances 上力度不足。论文可如实报告此 pattern 并讨论 statistical power limitation。\\n\\n\\n300 instances × 9 seeds 提供足够的 bootstrap 统计量力。best 档下 embed_vs_random 的 95% CI 不含零（[0.4, 4.2]pp），p=0.012，通过显著性检验。 CI 宽度 ~4pp 反映 SWE-bench 300 的固有 variance（每个 instance 是 binary outcome， binomial variance 较大）。9 seeds 降低了 training variance 的贡献， 但 evaluation set size（300）是 CI 宽度的主要 bottleneck。 Cross-seed R@1 标准差 ~1.0pp（在 [0.5, 1.5] 范围内）， 确认 training 方差可控。Dataflow CI 也不含零但上界更宽（[0.5, 5.8]）， 反映条件性收益的 inherent higher variance。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Inference-Time Graph Method Comparison Discussion\",\n    \"description\": \"与 CodexGraph, LocAgent 等 inference-time graph methods 的概念对比与定位\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"comparison_dimensions\": 4,\n      \"structfuse_strengths\": [\n        \"training-time, no inference overhead\",\n        \"model-agnostic mining\",\n        \"compatible with any retriever\"\n      ],\n      \"inference_methods_strengths\": [\n        \"dynamic graph, adapts to query\",\n        \"no precomputation needed\",\n        \"can leverage runtime call stacks\"\n      ],\n      \"complementarity_score\": \"high\",\n      \"empirical_comparison\": \"not applicable (different paradigm)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"Training-Time vs Inference-Time Structural Methods\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Dimension\",\n          \"StructFuse\",\n          \"CodexGraph_LocAgent\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Signal injection\",\n            \"Training (negative mining)\",\n            \"Inference (graph navigation)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Inference overhead\",\n            \"Zero\",\n            \"Per-query graph traversal\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Graph freshness\",\n            \"Static (pretrained)\",\n            \"Dynamic (query-adaptive)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Compatibility\",\n            \"Any contrastive retriever\",\n            \"Specific agent framework\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"清晰定位避免了 \\\"why not compare with X\\\" 的 reviewer 质疑。 Complementarity framing 开启了 future work 方向（combine training-time mining + inference-time navigation）。\\n\\n\\n这是 discussion section 的概念分析而非实验。best 档下不需要实际跑 inference-time baselines（GPU budget=0），而是提供清晰的 taxonomy：StructFuse 是 training-time structural signal injection（改善表征学习），inference-time methods 是 navigation-time structural signal（改善检索路径）。两者 complementary 而非 competitive。 核心区别：StructFuse 是 offline（一次 mine、反复 train），inference methods 是 online（每次 query 重新构建 graph）。StructFuse 的 overhead 在 training 时 已 amortize，inference 零成本；inference methods 每次 query 有额外延迟。 但 inference methods 能适应 query-specific context（如运行时调用栈），StructFuse 不能。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"M2 Full Qwen 9-Seed Results\",\n    \"description\": \"9 seeds × 3 strategies, Qwen2.5-Coder-3B, 全量 3-strategy 对比\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"random_mean_R1\": 0.533,\n      \"random_std_R1\": 0.008,\n      \"random_seeds\": [\n        0.527,\n        0.53,\n        0.531,\n        0.533,\n        0.534,\n        0.535,\n        0.536,\n        0.538,\n        0.54\n      ],\n      \"embedding_mean_R1\": 0.556,\n      \"embedding_std_R1\": 0.009,\n      \"embedding_seeds\": [\n        0.547,\n        0.55,\n        0.553,\n        0.555,\n        0.556,\n        0.558,\n        0.559,\n        0.561,\n        0.564\n      ],\n      \"dataflow_mean_R1\": 0.548,\n      \"dataflow_std_R1\": 0.01,\n      \"dataflow_seeds\": [\n        0.538,\n        0.541,\n        0.544,\n        0.547,\n        0.548,\n        0.55,\n        0.552,\n        0.555,\n        0.558\n      ],\n      \"embed_vs_random_delta_pp\": 2.3,\n      \"dataflow_vs_random_delta_pp\": 1.5,\n      \"dataflow_vs_embed_delta_pp\": -0.8,\n      \"embed_vs_random_bootstrap_p\": 0.003,\n      \"dataflow_vs_random_bootstrap_p\": 0.018,\n      \"cross_seed_R1_std_max\": 1.0,\n      \"best_checkpoint_step\": 1000,\n      \"step_1000_overfitting\": \"controlled via early stopping at step 500-1000\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"M2 Full Qwen: 9-Seed Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Strategy\",\n          \"Mean_R1\",\n          \"Std_R1\",\n          \"95% CI\",\n          \"Best_Step\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"random\",\n            0.533,\n            0.008,\n            \"[0.527, 0.539]\",\n            1000\n          ],\n          [\n            \"embedding_distance\",\n            0.556,\n            0.009,\n            \"[0.549, 0.563]\",\n            1000\n          ],\n          [\n            \"dataflow_aware\",\n            0.548,\n            0.01,\n            \"[0.540, 0.556]\",\n            \"500-1000\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"9-seed 全量结果是论文的 primary evidence for Claims 1 & 2。 Embedding > random 的 p=0.003 提供强统计支持。 Dataflow > random 的 p=0.018 提供充分支持但力度略弱（higher variance）， 精确对应 \\\"conditional benefit\\\" 叙事。\\n\\n\\nPilot 数据（单 seed）显示 random=0.5357, embed=0.5557, dataflow=0.5436。 best 档下 9-seed 平均值保持一致趋势但因 seed variance 略有修正。 Qwen pos_sim=0.9855 的饱和空间使 random negatives 太 easy（margin=0.074）， embedding mining 有效因为挑选 harder negatives（margin=0.017）。 Dataflow 的条件性收益（+1.5pp vs random）通过更 hard 的 structural negatives 进一步压缩 margin（margin=0.029），但 incremental 小于 embed 因为 embedding distance 已经捕获了大部分 difficulty gradient。Cross-seed std ~0.8-1.0pp， 在 [0.5, 1.5] 范围内，说明 training 方差可控。Step 1000 过拟合通过 early stopping at best validation loss 解决，不影响结论。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"M2 Full StarCoder 9-Seed Results\",\n    \"description\": \"9 seeds × 3 strategies, StarCoder2-3B, 全量交互效应验证\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"random_mean_R1\": 0.49,\n      \"random_std_R1\": 0.009,\n      \"embedding_mean_R1\": 0.507,\n      \"embedding_std_R1\": 0.01,\n      \"dataflow_mean_R1\": 0.488,\n      \"dataflow_std_R1\": 0.011,\n      \"embed_vs_random_delta_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"dataflow_vs_random_delta_pp\": -0.2,\n      \"embed_vs_random_bootstrap_p\": 0.008,\n      \"dataflow_vs_random_bootstrap_p\": 0.62,\n      \"cross_seed_R1_std_max\": 1.1\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"caption\": \"M2 Full StarCoder: 9-Seed Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Strategy\",\n          \"Mean_R1\",\n          \"Std_R1\",\n          \"95% CI\",\n          \"p_vs_random\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"random\",\n            0.49,\n            0.009,\n            \"[0.483, 0.497]\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"embedding_distance\",\n            0.507,\n            0.01,\n            \"[0.499, 0.515]\",\n            0.008\n          ],\n          [\n            \"dataflow_aware\",\n            0.488,\n            0.011,\n            \"[0.479, 0.497]\",\n            0.62\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"StarCoder 的 clean null result for dataflow 是论文 strongest mechanistic evidence。 两编码器的交互效应 pattern（embed always helps, dataflow conditional on saturation） 完美对应表征空间几何学解释。\\n\\nStarCoder pos_sim=0.7985（健康空间），random negatives 已提供足够 difficulty gradient （margin=0.194）。Embedding mining 仍然有效（+1.7pp, p=0.008），因为 embedding distance 选择的 negatives 更 informative regardless of space geometry——这是 Claim 1 的关键证据 （两个编码器均显著）。Dataflow 在 StarCoder 上无显著差异（-0.2pp, p=0.62）， 产生干净的交互效应：dataflow 的 structural negatives 在非饱和空间中不提供 beyond-embedding 的信息增量，因为 encoder 已能通过 text alone 区分结构上不同的文件。 这一 null result 是论文 mechanistic story 的关键支撑—— 不是所有方法在所有条件下都有效，而是有清晰的条件边界。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":832,"startLine":1,"totalLines":832}}}
